{"unit_id": "tag:0BX7:proof", "translation": "可以把<MATH_0001>换成<MATH_0002>在<MATH_0003>中的一个开邻域（open neighbourhood）（略去一处小（small）细节）。根据性质（Properties）篇引理<REF_0001>，可设<MATH_0004>是仿射的（affine），且<MATH_0005>。\n特别地，<MATH_0006>是整的（integral），有唯一的泛点（generic point）<MATH_0007>，其剩余域（residue field）是分式域（fraction field）<MATH_0008>，对应的环是赋值（valuation）环（ring）<MATH_0009>。\n由于<MATH_0010>在<MATH_0011>的闭包（closure）中，可知<MATH_0012>非空（not empty），因此<MATH_0013>包含<MATH_0014>。于是由固有性（properness）的赋值判据（valuative criterion）（引理<REF_0002>），存在态射（morphism）<MATH_0015>，它可置于如下交换图式（commutative diagram）中。\n<MATH_0016>\n其中的箭头都是概形（schemes）之间在<MATH_0017>上的态射（morphisms）。应用引理<REF_0003>，取<MATH_0018>和<MATH_0019>，得到开邻域（open neighbourhood）<MATH_0020>，它包含<MATH_0021>，并得到态射（morphism）<MATH_0022>，它在<MATH_0023>上，将<MATH_0024>送到<MATH_0025>且满足<MATH_0026>。\n由于<MATH_0027>是分离的（separated），等化子（equalizer）<MATH_0028>（关于<MATH_0029>与<MATH_0030>）是<MATH_0031>的闭子概形（closed subscheme），见概形（Schemes）篇引理<REF_0004>。\n按构造，<MATH_0032>与<MATH_0033>确定同一态射（morphism）<MATH_0034>，故<MATH_0035>包含整的（integral）概形（scheme）<MATH_0036>的泛点（generic point）。于是<MATH_0037>，从而<MATH_0038>与<MATH_0039>粘合（glue）成所求的态射（morphism）<MATH_0040>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "open neighbourhood", "target_term": "开邻域"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}, {"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "性质"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整的"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"source_term": "residue field", "target_term": "剩余域"}, {"source_term": "fraction field", "target_term": "分式域"}, {"source_term": "valuation", "target_term": "赋值"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "closure", "target_term": "闭包"}, {"source_term": "not empty", "target_term": "非空"}, {"source_term": "properness", "target_term": "固有性"}, {"source_term": "valuative criterion", "target_term": "赋值判据"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "com