{"unit_id": "tag:01W7:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们将采用<REF_0001>中射影态射（projective morphism）的定义。带有“H”的定义版本来自<REF_0002>。所得的两个定义不同。两个都有用。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["H"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射", "context": "本节采用的定义所涉及的对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01W8:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 称<MATH_0002>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>射影的（projective）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若<MATH_0003>作为<MATH_0004>-概形（scheme）同构（isomorphic）于射影（projective）丛（bundle）<MATH_0005>的一个闭子概形（closed subscheme），其中该丛取自某个拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）、有限型的（finite type）<MATH_0006>-模（module）<MATH_0007>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 称<MATH_0008>为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>H-射影的（H-projective）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，若存在整数（integer）<MATH_0009>及闭浸入（closed immersion）<MATH_0010>，后者在<MATH_0011>上。\n<STRUCT_0004> 称<MATH_0012>为<TEXTITOPEN_0003>局部射影的（locally projective）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，若存在开（open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0013>，使得每个<MATH_0014>都是射影的（projective）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "bundle", "target_term": "丛"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型的"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "H-projective", "target_term": "H-射影的"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "locally projective", "target_term": "局部射影的"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射的两端对象"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "定义考察的映射"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "第一项定义的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "同构所在的相对结构"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "第一项要求的等价关系"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "修饰第一项中的丛"}, {"source_term": "bundle", "target_term": "丛", "context": "闭子概形所在的对象"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "与给定对象同构的子对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的", "context": "构造丛的模所需的性质"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型的", "context": "构造丛的模所需的有限性"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "射影丛所用的结构"}, {"source_term": "H-projective", "target_term": "H-射影的", "context": "第二项定义的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数", "context": "第二项条件中须存在的数"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "第二项须存在的态射"}, {"source_term": "locally projective", "target_term": "局部射影的", "context": "第三项定义的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "第三项的覆盖所用的集合类型"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "第三项的局部化条件"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影的", "context": "第三项中各局部态射所需的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01W7:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n正如所料，射影态射（projective morphism）是拟射影的（quasi-projective），见引理<REF_0001>。反过来，拟射影（quasi-projective）态射（morphisms）往往是开浸入（open immersions）与射影（projective）态射（morphisms）的复合（compositions），见引理<REF_0002>。关于拟射影（quasi-projective）基底（base）上射影（projective）态射（morphisms）的性质综述，见态射（Morphisms）续篇第<REF_0003>节。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "open immersions", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "compositions", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影"}, {"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "projective morphism", "target_term": "射影态射", "context": "首句断言中的对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影的", "context": "射影态射所具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影", "context": "反方向所讨论的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "反方向所讨论的映射"}, {"source_term": "open immersions", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "复合中的一类态射"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "修饰复合中的另一类态射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "参与复合的射影映射"}, {"source_term": "compositions", "target_term": "复合", "context": "构成相关拟射影态射的运算"}, {"source_term": "quasi-projective", "target_term": "拟射影", "context": "综述中基底所具的性质"}, {"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底", "context": "综述中射影态射所处的基底"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "综述考察的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "综述考察的映射"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所引篇章名称中的术语"}], "notes": []}
